			"date": "2026-01-17T02:16:49.321Z",
			"content": "<p>“To keep the power in the hands of developers and honor its deep roots in open source, Netlify is committed to being good stewards of the Gatsby open-source project”</p><p>February 2023</p><p><a href=\"https://www.netlify.com/press/netlify-acquires-gatsby-inc-to-accelerate-adoption-of-composable-web-architectures/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">netlify.com/press/netlify-acqu</span><span class=\"invisible\">ires-gatsby-inc-to-accelerate-adoption-of-composable-web-architectures/</span></a></p>",
